From 4307aab274242cc336e91ff6d90b55fe0de111db Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: j8-a10 <noreply@example.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:54:55 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] sepolicy: add missing trailing newline to property_contexts

The sepolicy build concatenates every policy directory's property_contexts
through cpp. Without a final newline this file's last rule is glued to the next
file's first line, producing

  vendor.sys.qseecomd.enable u:object_r:vendor_default_prop:s0# Aux camera ...

and vendor_property_contexts fails with 'Type ... is not valid'.
---
 sepolicy/property_contexts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/sepolicy/property_contexts b/sepolicy/property_contexts
index 3696efe..6b5ae91 100644
--- a/sepolicy/property_contexts
+++ b/sepolicy/property_contexts
@@ -22,4 +22,4 @@ vendor.sys.qseecomd.                   u:object_r:vendor_qseecomd_prop:s0
 vendor.tzdaemon                        u:object_r:vendor_tzdaemon_prop:s0
 vendor.tzts_daemon                     u:object_r:vendor_tztsdaemon_prop:s0
 vendor.wlbtd.                          u:object_r:vendor_wlbtd_prop:s0
-vendor.sys.qseecomd.enable             u:object_r:vendor_default_prop:s0
\ No newline at end of file
+vendor.sys.qseecomd.enable             u:object_r:vendor_default_prop:s0
-- 
2.34.1

